      "locked": false,
      "text": "How a match is decided\n\n• the recall or investigation\n  covers this make, model\n  and model year\n\n• its component and text\n  match the failure mode's\n  rules (same words the\n  complaints matched)\n\n• an investigation that cites\n  a matched recall covers\n  the same failure (remedy\n  checks such as EA26005)\n\nEvery status links to its\nNHTSA source.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How a match is decided\n\n• the recall or investigation\n  covers this make, model\n  and model year\n\n• its component and text\n  match the failure mode's\n  rules (same words the\n  complaints matched)\n\n• an investigation that cites\n  a matched recall covers\n  the same failure (remedy\n  checks such as EA26005)\n\nEvery status links to its\nNHTSA source.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
